[h2]Build 0.9.54[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]Steam vents blow a jet of steam[/b] out of their outlet, sized to the heat they're venting: a wisp at a few hundred watts, a hard jet at full 3000W. Wall vents blow straight out from the wall; ground vents towards the cell they face.
[*][b]Exhaust ports blow a jet of fumes[/b], sized to the toxic gas coming through: yellow-green, and browner with rot stink from burnt corpses. The stack sends a plume up from its top; wall ports blow out from the wall.
[/list]
